<title>USA: Catalina Lighting starts production in China.</title>
<headline>Catalina Lighting starts production in China.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Catalina Lighting Inc said Monday it started production of lamps and lighting fixtures at its new $4.7 million plant in China's Shenzhen province.</p>
<p>The plant, which operates as part of Catalina's wholly-owned subsidiary Go-Gro Industries, substantially increases the company's aggregate production, a statement said. Catalina is a manufacturer and distributor of lighting products.</p>
